        "id": 175581,
        "name": "Reverend Pete",
        "username": "Reverend_Pete",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/278dde/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-05-13T13:08:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"emcg575797\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/emcg575797/48/2440_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> emcg575797:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Am I alone in being blah about the other stretch goals, and just wanting Story Mode?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>No.</p>\n<p>Story Mode is all I ever wanted. All I ever needed. Is here in my arms. Words are very unnecessary. They can only do harm.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Oops. I accidentally mashed up my Story Mode with Depeche Mode.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>But yes, I too am excited about Story Mode above all else.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
