        "created_at": "2016-05-13T17:22:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Reverend Pete\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Reverend Pete:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>emcg575797 wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Am I alone in being blah about the other stretch goals, and just wanting Story Mode?\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp;No.Story Mode is all I ever wanted. All I ever needed. Is here in my arms. Words are very unnecessary. They can only do harm.&nbsp;Oops. I accidentally mashed up my Story Mode with Depeche Mode.&nbsp;But yes, I too am excited about Story Mode above all else.&nbsp;&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>In all fairness, Depeche Mode are musical visionaries whose legacy runs deep.</p>",
